{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301640","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301640","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1830164001:1":{"text":"我准备了这么多年，好不容易才来到诺珐斯，就想着能再见一见你！结果你……你竟然……！","source_cn":"我准备了这么多年，好不容易才来到诺珐斯，就想着能再见一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D33344773AF0C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830164002:1":{"text":"——你竟然在这边有了新的家庭！","source_cn":"——你竟然在这边有了新的家庭！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81A74061C98773CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830164003:1":{"text":"罗莎……我已经去世二十年了，我以为你肯定会忘了我的……","source_cn":"罗莎……我已经去世二十年了，我以为你肯定会忘了我的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x417BD968CCE43EAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830164004:1":{"text":"放下过去吧，罗莎……你该向前看了。别让我这样一个死人耽误了你的大好人生。","source_cn":"放下过去吧，罗莎……你该向前看了。别让我这样一个死人耽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B50F3467817F0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830164005:1":{"text":"雷德……你怎么能说出这样的话？！","source_cn":"雷德……你怎么能说出这样的话？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6950CCFEAF91382B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_titl